# Treat these as binary so git never emits a text diff for them. Without this, a
# changed or deleted PDF gets diffed as text and the extracted content carries bytes
# that are not valid UTF-8, which crashes anything that reads `git diff` as a string
# (rsl_rl's logger stores a code-state diff at the start of every training run).
*.pdf binary
*.stl binary
*.obj binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.pt binary
